OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity puts 'Hogwarts campus'
OL,4,Aon the market
OL,5,
OL,6,FA set of historic university buildings
OL,7,Fdubbed by students as the "Hogwarts
OL,8,Fcampus" has gone on the market.
OL,10,FThe University of Gloucestershire said
OL,11,FFrancis Close Hall Campus, located just
OL,12,Foutside Cheltenham town centre, had
OL,13,Fbeen placed on the market to establish
OL,14,Finterest and "explore options for the
OL,15,Flong-term future" of the site.
OL,17,FThe campus dates back to 1847 and
OL,18,Ffeatures Grade II-listed gothic
OL,19,Fbuildings constructed of Cotswold stone
OL,20,Falongside more modern facilities.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
