OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity puts 'Hogwarts campus'
OL,4,Aon the market
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is important to be clear that this
OL,7,Fdoes not mean the campus has been sold
OL,8,For that we have already decided what
OL,9,Fwill happen to it," said Camille
OL,10,FStallard, chief financial officer at
OL,11,Fthe university.
